# =============================================================================
# TerraPulse — Environment Variables Configuration Template
# =============================================================================

# Google Gemini API Key (Gemini 2.5 Flash for agentic reasoning and synthesis)
# Acquire an API key from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Open Government Data (data.gov.in) API Key (Agmarknet APMC Mandi prices)
# Register and generate an API key at: https://data.gov.in/
DATA_GOV_API_KEY=your_data_gov_api_key_here

# Unauthenticated Public Streams (No API Key Required):
# - Copernicus Sentinel-2 L2A STAC Assets: https://earth-search.aws.element84.com/v1
# - Open-Meteo ERA5 Reanalysis & Seamless Forecast: https://api.open-meteo.com/v1
# - ISRIC World Soil Information (SoilGrids 250m REST API): https://rest.isric.org/soilgrids/v2.0
# - NASA POWER Agro-Climatology Daily API: https://power.larc.nasa.gov/api
# - ISRO Bhuvan Web Map Service (WMS LULC 1:50K): https://bhuvan-vec2.nrsc.gov.in/bhuvan/wms
